'pwd_DESCRIPTION' => ' 為了改變您的帳號密碼，請填寫下列表單。您需要提供帳號名稱、舊密碼與新密碼(新密碼必須輸入兩次)。 倘若您無法修改新密碼，那表示您可能已經忘記舊密碼，您的系統管理人員可以從伺服器管理中重設密碼。 ',
'pwd_TAINTED_USER' => '(en)The account name "[_1]" contains invalid characters.',
'pwd_TAINTED_PASSWORD' => '(en)The new password starts with invalid characters.',
'pwd_FIELDS_REQUIRED' => '所有欄位皆為必填',
'pwd_ERROR_PASSWORD_CHANGE' => '(en)An error occurred while attempting to change your password. Please make sure that the old password entered is correct. Old and new passwords should be different.',
'pwd_PASSWORD_CHANGE' => '變更密碼',
# ORPHANED (no longer in userpassword_en.lex; kept for reference, commented out by lex-to-po.pl): 'pwd_RESET_PASSWORD_TITLE' => '重設使用者密碼',
'pwd_ACCOUNT_PASSWORD_CHANGE' => '變更帳戶密碼',
'pwd_PASSWORD_VERIFY_NEW' => '新密碼（確認）：',
